&lt;p&gt;    My 2 cts here:&lt;br/&gt;
    Yep the scatter chart bug in 1.8.5 is annoying, and unfortunately nvd3 does not seem to release very frequently ( 2-3 times a year or so). However I am not sure reverting the lib from 1.8.5 to 1.7.1 is the right move, keep in mind that  *&lt;b&gt;a lot of bugs&lt;/b&gt;* were fixed between those two releases.&lt;br/&gt;
    Reverting to 1.7.1 is very likely to reintroduce (or maintain) a lot of others bugs. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    I wonder if we could do something directly in Zeppelin&apos;s visualization code to workaround the voronoi issue you spotted until 1.8.6 is released. Your thoughts?    &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
